/E (During the development of the QuickServe Ordering System, the team encountered several technical challenges such as sorting and ordering system issues, images not displaying properly, and coding errors. Problems also occurred when connecting MongoDB due to incorrect .env configurations and database connection settings. And the  API testing in Thunder Client, incorrect terminal directories, and MongoDB network whitelisting caused further difficulties that required continuous debugging and testing to resolve.)
/Pg 21 0 R
