296 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (The QuickServe Ordering System can be enhanced by adding more advanced features and improving overall performance. The system can include real-time order notifications through email or SMS to keep customers updated on their orders. An improved admin dashboard with sales reports, analytics, and inventory management can help monitor business operations better. The user interface can also be upgraded with a more modern design, better animations, and mobile responsiveness. Stronger security measures can be added to protect user data and improve system safety. The system can be optimized to handle more users and products for better scalability. Additional features like search filters, customer reviews, and order history tracking can further improve the user experience.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
